{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.940000534057617,"text":"A room moved in whole, the study of Niko's kazantakis, with his table, his books, his glasses, and his manuscripts. It is a strange exhibit, because it is neither rare nor valuable, it is simply real. It shows that books do not appear from nowhere. Somebody sat in a chair, day after day, and wrote by hand the pages that were later read in dozens of languages.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.800000011920929},{"word":"room","start":0.800000011920929,"end":0.8399999737739563},{"word":"moved","start":0.8399999737739563,"end":1.2599999904632568},{"word":"in","start":1.2599999904632568,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"whole","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"the","start":2.259999990463257,"end":2.4600000381469727},{"word":"study","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.799999952316284},{"word":"of","start":2.799999952316284,"end":3.4800000190734863},{"word":"Niko's","start":3.4800000190734863,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"kazantakis","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":4.159999847412109},{"word":"with","start":4.860000133514404,"end":4.940000057220459},{"word":"his","start":4.940000057220459,"end":5.159999847412109},{"word":"table","start":5.159999847412109,"end":5.519999980926514},{"word":"his","start":5.900000095367432,"end":6.480000019073486},{"word":"books","start":6.480000019073486,"end":6.480000019073486},{"word":"his","start":6.699999809265137,"end":7.039999961853027},{"word":"glasses","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.420000076293945},{"word":"and","start":7.559999942779541,"end":7.739999771118164},{"word":"his","start":7.739999771118164,"end":8.0600004196167},{"word":"manuscripts","start":8.0600004196167,"end":8.460000038146973},{"word":"It","start":9.020000457763672,"end":9.359999656677246},{"word":"is","start":9.359999656677246,"end":9.5},{"word":"a","start":9.5,"end":10.079999923706055},{"word":"strange","start":10.079999923706055,"end":10.07999992